                     <content styleCode="bold">Inactive ingredients </content>
                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>acacia, crospovidone, D&amp;C red no. 30 aluminum lake, D&amp;C red no. 7, dextrose monohydrate, ethylcellulose, FD&amp;C blue no. 1 aluminum lake, flavors, hydroxypropyl cellulose, magnesium stearate, microcrystalline cellulose, sucralose, sucrose, tartaric acid</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250416"/>
            </section>
         </component>
